  "brief": { "zh": "取回东展厅的星盘和西展厅的月石，赶上北门的末班车。未取齐两件展品时，北门不会算作撤离。展馆的环廊连接东西两翼，中央大厅是捷径。两台守点机各守一个展厅，两台追击机在馆内移动。", "en": "Retrieve the east gallery’s Star Dial and the west gallery’s Moonstone, then board the last tram at the north exit. The tram accepts you only with both exhibits. The ring connects the two galleries and the central hall offers a shortcut. Two sentries guard the galleries and two hunters move through the museum." },
